# Flo Compass — project context

- **Product:** Flo Compass — event companion for session discovery, My Plan, and AI Q&A (see `flo-compass-product.mdc`)
- **Stack:** Flutter 3.44.0 web, Dart 3.10+, Material 3, Docker/nginx
- **Local dev:** Ubuntu 24.04 WSL2 — see `wsl2-development.mdc`
- **Production:** GitHub Actions → GHCR image → Fly.io (`fly.toml`, `.github/workflows/ci-deploy.yml`)

## Shipping style

- Ship the smallest working slice first; demoable beats perfect
- No premature abstractions or unrelated refactors
- Respect `analysis_options.yaml` (`flutter_lints`)
- Do not create git commits unless explicitly asked
- Do not add markdown/docs unless requested

## Architecture

- Prefer a thin `lib/data/` / `lib/services/` / `lib/core/` layer; never scatter HTTP calls in widgets
- State management is Provider-based today; do not introduce a second state library without an explicit decision
